aderivative audio filter (src/audio/aderivative.ts)

src/audio/aderivative.ts adapts the aderivative filter of FFmpeg
libavfilter/af_aderivative.c: the DERIVATIVE(name,type) loops for s16p, s32p,
fltp and dblp (dst[n] = src[n] - prev; prev = src[n], per channel, with prev
starting at zero and carried across frames) and the FILTER_SAMPLEFMTS list
s16p, fltp, s32p, dblp.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
